cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use dits, please cite it as below."
title: dits
abstract: >-
  Open-source (CPAL-1.0), voice-first AI mock-interview platform. It reads a CV and
  job description, researches the target company, runs an adaptive real-time voice
  interview with a stylized video avatar, scores it, and coaches weak areas.
  English-first, multilingual. A fork of DeepInterview by Pham Van Ngoan and the
  DeepInterview contributors (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/ngoanpv/DeepInterview).
type: software
license: CPAL-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/espetro/dits"
authors:
  - name: "Joaquin Terrasa and the dits contributors"
references:
